<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN STARTS HAGEMEYER .</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN STARTS HAGEMEYER .</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch trading group Hagemeyer NV was started as a &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2.20 guilders at 99.00 guilders by 1050 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
